# RFC 9208 section 4.2: a quota root without limits still gets a QUOTA response, with an empty resource list
C: A001 GETQUOTAROOT INBOX
S: \* QUOTAROOT "INBOX" "#private&imapuser"
S: \* QUOTA "#private&imapuser" \(\)
S: A001 OK GETQUOTAROOT completed.

C: A002 GETQUOTA "#private&imapuser"
S: \* QUOTA "#private&imapuser" \(\)
S: A002 OK GETQUOTA completed.
